READING:
 half fold  (sigma): a PERMUTATION of the holonomy word -- internal to the star algebra.
 quarter fold (phi): a TRANSLATION of the holonomy word by eps -- transverse, free for n>=5,
                     costing exactly ONE holonomy bit (the odd-cycle-size functional).
